# lane c2-fx: the effect dispatch table's oracle (c_te_effect_dispatch.cpp).
# The registrations in stock's walk order, then stock's lookup for every
# DECLARE_CLIENT_EFFECT name in the fork and ours (registered here or not), in
# five spellings each, then live dispatches from cs_te_fire all (fxrun lines).
wait iface-list 120
cmd map dm_lockdown
wait first paint 240
sleep 3
cmd sv_cheats 1
cmd cs_cl_probe_fxreg
cmd cs_cl_probe_fxlookup AirboatGunHeavyTracer AIRBOATGUNHEAVYTRACER airboatgunheavytracer AirboatGunHeavyTracerx AirboatGunHeavyTrace AirboatGunImpact AIRBOATGUNIMPACT airboatgunimpact AirboatGunImpactx AirboatGunImpac AirboatGunTracer AIRBOATGUNTRACER
